r04m","source":"AIHOT"},"category":"industry","id":"vsfne926njom5wnadceo8r04m","permalink":"https://aihot.news/items/vsfne926njom5wnadceo8r04m","published_at":"2026-11-13T16:00:50Z","ref":"A9","score":84,"selected":true,"source":"X：Anthropic (@AnthropicAI)","summary":"Anthropic 预告美东时间中午 12 点直播 Dario Amodei 与 JPMorgan CEO Jamie Dimon 的炉边谈话，链接为 https://www.youtube.com/live/YHEaEpeY3ew。","title":"Anthropic 直播 Dario Amodei 与 JPMorgan CEO Jamie Dimon 炉边谈话并披露 SEC 注册声明","title_en":"Streaming live at 12 PM ET: A fireside chat with JPMorgan CEO Jamie Dimon and @DarioAmodei. https://www.youtube.com/live/YHEaEpeY3ew","url":"https://x.com/AnthropicAI/status/2121272083863011714"},{"attribution":{"canonical":"https://aihot.news/items/um8pmpa91qn1ymvx3pux0sq1x","source":"AIHOT"},"category":"ai-products","id":"um8pmpa91qn1ymvx3pux0sq1x","permalink":"https://aihot.news/items/um8pmpa91qn1ymvx3pux0sq1x","published_at":"2026-11-13T15:13:14Z","ref":"A10","score":71,"selected":true,"source":"X：Clément Delangue（Hugging Face CEO） (@ClementDelangue)","summary":"Hugging Face CEO Clément Delangue 与 @ggerganov 宣布 llama.cpp v1.0.0 发布，这是这个最常用的本地运行 AI 模型库的首个完全稳定大版本。作者称用户可在手机、笔记本和工作站上免费掌控自己的智能，不向任何人发送数据，并承诺支持所有硬件、平台和模型类型，让 AI 分布式而非集中于少数硅谷机构。","title":"llama.cpp v1.0.0 发布，本地运行 AI 模型迎来首个稳定大版本","title_en":"We’re not going to win by lobbying, plotting, or manipulating. We’re going to win by building, in the open, with the whole community!","url":"https://x.com/ClementDelangue/status/2121260104913768931"},{"attribution":{"canonical":"https://aihot.news/items/pdhda5tufq7ubi8w17bys7w66","source":"AIHOT"},"category":"industry","id":"pdhda5tufq7ubi8w17bys7w66","permalink":"https://aihot.news/items/pdhda5tufq7ubi8w17bys7w66","published_at":"2026-11-13T12:52:19Z","ref":"A11","score":81,"selected":true,"source":"TechCrunch：AI（RSS）","summary":"Nvidia 前CEO黄仁勋辞职后，以色列科技界关注这家在其拥有6000名员工和最大海外研发中心的公司是否会继续深耕以色列。多位以色列投资人认为，Nvidia 决策放缓可能给 AI 芯片和推理软件领域的竞争者留出空间，但如果不确定性也拖慢 AI 支出，竞争者面对的可能是更小的市场机会。","title":"Nvidia 领导层变动引发以